Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:36.43,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,搞快点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.14,0:00:39.65,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,门打不开  上锁了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.65,0:00:40.74,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:42.43,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,哥哥  快点过来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.61,0:00:44.95,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,门被锁上打不开了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:53.85,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,救我…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.95,0:00:52.21,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,大树？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:55.51,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,在你的书房里…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.03,0:01:00.92,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,大…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.05,0:01:03.24,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,大树
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.21,0:01:18.26,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,他的心肺停止了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:20.00,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,必须马上进行心肺复苏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.24,0:01:22.01,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,快点去叫救护车
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.01,0:01:22.80,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,是！
